WEBVTT

00:17:59.946 --> 00:18:03.376
I want a Selfie with Sundar,
which I have to do.

00:18:03.376 --> 00:18:06.016
I'm not going to force him 
to show the six-pack.

00:18:06.356 --> 00:18:09.180
We'll do the six-pack 
when I come to California next time.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:10.524
You and I both now.

00:18:10.524 --> 00:18:12.384
SP: I thought you had an eight-pack.

00:18:12.384 --> 00:18:14.996
(Laughter)

00:18:15.656 --> 00:18:19.203
I will search on Google 
if I have a six or an eight pack.

00:18:19.203 --> 00:18:21.104
Google will tell me.

00:18:21.104 --> 00:18:23.424
Honestly that was great fun.

00:18:23.424 --> 00:18:26.390
Many people wouldn't believe
I had a six- pack.

00:18:26.395 --> 00:18:28.932
I went to his office and showed it

00:18:28.932 --> 00:18:30.799
and then everybody believed it is real